  "instructions": [
    "Soak the dried white navy beans in water overnight, then drain and set aside.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a claypot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion to the claypot and saute until softened.",
    "Add the minced garlic to the claypot and saute for 1 minute.",
    "Add the soaked navy beans, salt, black pepper, and cumin to the claypot.",
    "Pour in 4 cups of water and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the stew for 45 minutes, or until the beans are tender.",
    "Serve the stew hot, with optional pita bread on the side."
  ],
